{"id":7528,"date":"2022-03-04T15:03:23","date_gmt":"2022-03-04T14:03:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=7528"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:01:47","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:01:47","slug":"cyclerecyclez-bientot-a-hoenheim","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/cyclerecyclez-bientot-a-hoenheim\/","title":{"rendered":"\u00ab\u00a0Cycle&#038;Recyclez\u00a0\u00bb bient\u00f4t \u00e0 Hoenheim!"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-0-0\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"a5296-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"a5296-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"a5296-0-0\">Thierry OTT, Directeur chez Skoda Hoenheim a rencontr\u00e9 David MICELI, Pr\u00e9sident et Daniel ZUGMEYER, Vice Pr\u00e9sident de l&rsquo;association Cycle &amp; Recycle Hoenheim. En pr\u00e9sence du Maire Vincent DEBES, le partenaire de la nouvelle association en cours d&rsquo;installation dans l&rsquo;ancienne caserne des pompiers \u00e0 l&rsquo;arri\u00e8re de la mairie, a t\u00e9moign\u00e9 de tout son soutien pour ce projet solidaire.<\/span><\/div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"a5296-0-0\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"bcp5e-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"bcp5e-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"bcp5e-0-0\">A cette occasion, le Directeur de la Marque automobile a lanc\u00e9 une invitation. Il accueille l&rsquo;\u00e9quipe chez Skoda Hoenheim, 33 route de Brumath \u00e0 l\u2019occasion de leurs portes-ouvertes, samedi 12 et dimanche 13 mars entre 9h et 17h pour vous offrir une \u00ab r\u00e9vision-graissage \u00bb \u00e0 votre v\u00e9lo. <\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"3qjhs-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"3qjhs-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3qjhs-0-0\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"2940j-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"2940j-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"2940j-0-0\">Avant tout passionn\u00e9s, ils ont les bons gestes pour remettre en forme tout deux roues qui passe entre leurs mains. Apprenez \u00e0 r\u00e9parer votre v\u00e9lo \u00e0 leur c\u00f4t\u00e9, ils vous transmettront \u00e9galement leur passion !<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"c3kd7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"c3kd7-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"c3kd7-0-0\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"c4u3d-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"c4u3d-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"c4u3d-0-0\">Cr\u00e9ateurs d&rsquo;objets d\u00e9riv\u00e9s \u00e0 partir des pi\u00e8ces d\u00e9tach\u00e9es de ces \u00ab\u00a0petites reines\u00a0\u00bb, d\u00e9couvrez un article complet sur la naissance de cette association qui para\u00eetra dans l&rsquo;Edition Printemps 2022 du Vivre \u00e0 Hoenheim \u00e0 partir du 17 mars, dans vos bo\u00eetes aux lettre. <\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"8tski-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"8tski-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8tski-0-0\">\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"99o4e\" data-offset-key=\"4p614-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"4p614-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"4p614-0-0\">Dans l&rsquo;attente de leur ouverture prochaine au public vous pourrez noter leurs coordonn\u00e9es qui ont rejoint la liste des associations le la Ville sur https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/test-photo-2\/<\/span><\/div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"4p614-0-0\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"4p614-0-0\"><span class=\"_5zk7\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-0-0\">#velo<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"_5zk7\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-2-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-2-0\">#association<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"_5zk7\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-4-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-4-0\">#reparation<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"_5zk7\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-6-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8mlvj-6-0\">#12et13mars2022<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Thierry OTT, Directeur chez Skoda Hoenheim a rencontr\u00e9 David MICELI, Pr\u00e9sident et Daniel ZUGMEYER, Vice Pr\u00e9sident de l&rsquo;association Cycle &amp; Recycle Hoenheim. En pr\u00e9sence du Maire Vincent DEBES, le partenaire de la nouvelle association en cours d&rsquo;installation dans l&rsquo;ancienne caserne des pompiers \u00e0 l&rsquo;arri\u00e8re de la mairie, a t\u00e9moign\u00e9 de tout son soutien pour ce [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":7529,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31,18],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7528"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7528"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7528\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7531,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville